Package: RNAflow
Title: An Interactive Shiny Platform for End-to-End RNA-seq Analysis
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Karim", "Matmat", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "karim.matmat@example.com",
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: RNAflow is a modular Shiny application packaged as an R package
    for end-to-end bulk RNA-seq analysis. It takes raw count matrices and
    sample metadata as input and provides differential expression analysis
    (DESeq2), visualization (volcano, heatmap, PCA), functional enrichment
    (GSEA, ORA against MSigDB / GO / KEGG / Reactome), co-expression network
    analysis (WGCNA) and reproducible HTML report generation. Supports human,
    mouse and rat organisms with publication-ready figure exports.
